{
  "name": "CIRI — Error Handler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "err-trigger-001",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        250,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "err-msg",
              "name": "error_message",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution.error.message }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "err-node",
              "name": "failed_node",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution.lastNodeExecuted }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "err-exec-url",
              "name": "execution_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution.url }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "err-wf-name",
              "name": "workflow_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.workflow.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "err-timestamp",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "err-set-001",
      "name": "Extraer Info de Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $vars.API_BASE_URL || 'https://ciri-chargeback-agent.onrender.com' }}/api/alerts/",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ event_type: 'n8n_execution_error', severity: 'ERROR', message: 'Error en ' + $json.workflow_name + ': ' + $json.error_message, source: 'n8n', transaction_id: null, metadata: { failed_node: $json.failed_node, execution_url: $json.execution_url, workflow_name: $json.workflow_name, timestamp: $json.timestamp } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        },
        "sendHeaders": false
      },
      "id": "err-http-001",
      "name": "Registrar Alerta en API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        750,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "noreply@ciri-agent.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $vars.ALERT_EMAIL }}",
        "subject": "={{ '[CIRI] Error en ' + $('Extraer Info de Error').first().json.workflow_name }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ 'Error: ' + $('Extraer Info de Error').first().json.error_message + '\\n\\nNodo: ' + $('Extraer Info de Error').first().json.failed_node + '\\nEjecucion: ' + $('Extraer Info de Error').first().json.execution_url + '\\nTimestamp: ' + $('Extraer Info de Error').first().json.timestamp }}"
      },
      "id": "err-email-001",
      "name": "Enviar Email de Alerta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        300
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Error Handler\n\nCaptura errores no manejados del workflow principal.\n\n**Funciona sin configuracion**: la alerta se registra en la API publica por defecto.\n\n**Setup (todo opcional):**\n1. Workflow Principal -> Settings -> Error Workflow -> seleccionar este workflow\n2. Variables -> `API_BASE_URL` si usas tu propia API\n3. Para el email: crear credencial SMTP, setear la variable `ALERT_EMAIL` y habilitar el nodo (viene deshabilitado para que importe limpio)\n\n**Flujo:** Error Trigger -> Extraer Info -> POST /api/alerts/ -> Send Email",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 450,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "err-sticky-001",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Error Handler",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        20
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Error Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extraer Info de Error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Extraer Info de Error": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Registrar Alerta en API",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Registrar Alerta en API": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Enviar Email de Alerta",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "tags": [],
  "triggerCount": 1
}